abstract: >-
  A Unity Package Manager plugin for offline VAO 0.4.0 and pinned 0.5.0
  validation, typed scientific and physical signal inspection, transactional
  and selective import, rights-aware runtime materialization, deterministic
  execution, Playables animation, optional MIDI and XR bridges, and
  position-aware RIR/SOFA rendering.
